    "shortDesc": "Bail application in offences under Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act, 2012, addressing statutory presumptions under Sections 29 and 30 POCSO.",
    "limitationNotice": "Victim Notice Mandatory: Notice to informant/victim must be served through Child Welfare Police Officer prior to hearing.",
