    "shortDesc": "Application for relaxation of onerous conditions, waiver of local surety mandate, or reduction of exorbitant security amount.",
    "limitationNotice": "Apex Court Guidance: Conditions of bail must not be impossible or onerous so as to render grant of bail illusory (M.S. Bindra doctrine).",
