    "statute": "Supreme Court of India • Rajnesh v. Neha (2020) 10 SCC 703 & Section 144 BNSS",
    "title": "Mandatory Affidavit of Disclosure of Assets and Liabilities for Maintenance (*Rajnesh v. Neha*)",
    "shortDesc": "Comprehensive sworn affidavit of income, assets, liabilities, bank accounts, and monthly expenditure strictly conforming to Supreme Court Rajnesh v. Neha mandates.",
    "limitationNotice": "Mandatory Pre-Condition: Must be filed simultaneously with maintenance pleadings in all matrimonial disputes in India.",
