    "title": "Standard Court Vakalatnama and Memorandum of Appearance",
    "shortDesc": "Comprehensive Vakalatnama and Memo of Appearance for District Courts, Sessions Court, and High Court empowering counsel to plead, act, compromise, and inspect records.",
